  "scope": [
    "Acyclic scalar borrow creation events retain their original target, entry value and pending final-value slot.",
    "Saved-target resolution handles moved/reassigned reference slots without rereading a historical slot.",
    "Direct PCG parent edges establish guarded child-parent identity; suspension and resumption are checked.",
    "Pending values are not exposed or assumed; the final-value slot is assigned after checked restoration.",
    "Loop instances, package/escaping continuations, non-scalar transfers and full prophecy summaries remain separate R2/R3 work."
  ],
